@startuml
title US-004 - Register resource - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Association Staff" as Staff
participant "RegisterResourcePage" as View
participant "RegisterResourceForm" as Component
participant "resourcesService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  Resource-management roles and the recognized type vocabulary\nremain open. Organization comes from the caller.
end note

Staff -> View: Submit name, type, and description
activate View
View -> Component: handleSubmit(name, type, description)
activate Component
Component -> Service: register(name, type, description)
activate Service
Service -> Http: POST /resources (RegisterResourceDto)
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request (auth token attached)
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> Http: 201 Created (ResourceDto)
else Request rejected
    API --> Http: 400/403/500
end
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response data or rejected request
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: ResourceDto, or thrown error
deactivate Service
alt Successful response
    Component --> View: Resource created with status Available
else Failed response
    Component --> View: Error state (validation / operation failure)
end
deactivate Component
View --> Staff: Render the resulting state
deactivate View
@enduml
